OL,3,GNEWSAMet hands Grenfell fire
OL,4,Ainvestigation file to CPS
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police has submitted
OL,7,Fits final investigation file into the
OL,8,FGrenfell Tower fire to the Crown
OL,9,FProsecution Service (CPS), the force
OL,10,Fhas announced.
OL,12,FTwenty companies and organisations as
OL,13,Fwell as 54 individuals could face
OL,14,Fcriminal charges, the force said.
OL,16,FIt has previously described the case as
OL,17,Fone of the "most complex investigations
OL,18,Fever undertaken by any UK law
OL,19,Fenforcement agency".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
